Yes, you can get your money back. Atlas detects most duplicate charges within 24 hours and refunds
them automatically, and Support also refunds the duplicate charge as soon as it is reported [2,
3]. Refunds to cards appear on your card statement within 5 to 10 business days, while refunds of
direct debits take up to 3 business days [3].

